  "title": "【2026シルバーウィーク】混雑を避けたい人へ！穴場の温泉宿＆隠れ家リゾート6選｜秘湯・一棟貸し・離れの宿",
  "hotel_name": "【2026シルバーウィーク】混雑を避けたい人へ！穴場の温泉宿＆隠れ家リゾート6選｜秘湯・一棟貸し・離れの宿",
  "description": "2026年シルバーウィークの混雑を回避！秘湯・一棟貸し・離れの隠れ家温泉宿を楽天トラベルから厳選。人混みを避けてゆったり過ごしたい大人のための穴場特集。",
  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\">【2026シルバーウィーク】混雑を避けたい人へ！穴場の温泉宿＆隠れ家リゾート6選｜秘湯・一棟貸し・離れの宿</h2>\n<p>11年ぶりの大型連休、でも<strong>「人混みは苦手…」「静かにのんびり過ごしたい」</strong>という方も多いはず。そんな方にこそおすすめしたいのが、メジャーな観光地を外した<strong>秘湯・離れの宿・一棟貸し</strong>の隠れ家ステイです。</p>\n<p>楽天トラベルで見つけた<strong>知る人ぞ知る穴場の温泉宿</strong>を集めました。喧騒から離れて、秋の自然に包まれる至福の時間をどうぞ。</p>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 mb-3\">📌 目次</h3>\n  <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700 font-medium\">\n    <li><a href=\"#how\" class=\"hover:underline\">1. 🔍 穴場の宿を見つける3つのコツ</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#ranking\" class=\"hover:underline\">2. 🏨 穴場の温泉宿＆隠れ家リゾート6選</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 id=\"how\">🔍 1. 穴場の宿を見つける3つのコツ</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-emerald-950 text-sm\">① 新幹線が止まらない駅の周辺を狙う</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-900/80 mt-1\">アクセスがやや不便な温泉地は、大型連休でも空いていることが多い。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-teal-950 text-sm\">② 客室数10室以下の小規模宿を選ぶ</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-900/80 mt-1\">大型旅館と違い、少人数制の宿は静かで落ち着いた滞在が約束される。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-green-50 border border-green-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-green-950 text-sm\">③ 「一棟貸し」「離れ」で検索する</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-green-900/80 mt-1\">他の宿泊客と接触がなく、完全プライベートな空間で過ごせる。</p></div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 id=\"ranking\">🏨 おすすめ宿・ホテル一覧</h2>\n<p>楽天トラベルで人気の実在施設をまとめています。全国の名湯・名宿の中から、テーマに合った高評価の宿を選んでみました。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第1位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">北海道</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.71 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/50586/50586.jpg\" alt=\"夕茜舎（あかねやど）\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">夕茜舎（あかねやど）</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">茜色に染まる十勝岳連峰の夕映えが素敵！眺めが自慢のゲストハウス</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F50586%2F50586.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 穴場の宿を今すぐチェック\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第2位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">長野県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.54 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/135480/135480.jpg\" alt=\"穂高温泉郷　御宿　穂高城\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">穂高温泉郷　御宿　穂高城</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">豪商が建てた豪壮な別荘=隠れ家です。その荘厳な佇まいと非日常の雰囲気を存分にお楽しみください。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F135480%2F135480.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 穴場の宿を今すぐチェック\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第3位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">栃木県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.62 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/151342/151342.jpg\" alt=\"日光・奥鬼怒温泉郷の山の宿　八丁の湯\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">日光・奥鬼怒温泉郷の山の宿　八丁の湯</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">日光国立公園内・奥鬼怒の手つかずの大自然に囲まれた秘境に佇む宿。関東最後の秘湯を是非お楽しみ下さい。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F151342%2F151342.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 穴場の宿を今すぐチェック\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第4位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">新潟県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.79 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/75319/75319.jpg\" alt=\"赤倉温泉　旅館　おかやま\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">赤倉温泉　旅館　おかやま</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">混雑ゼロ、人が少ない温泉地を巡る静かな旅へ／温泉は100％源泉かけ流し天然温泉／美食と良き湯を堪能！</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F75319%2F75319.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 穴場の宿を今すぐチェック\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第5位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">鹿児島県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.76 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/143298/143298.jpg\" alt=\"全室源泉掛け流し温泉付離れの旅館　四季の杜　紫尾庵\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">全室源泉掛け流し温泉付離れの旅館　四季の杜　紫尾庵</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">わずか8室の離れの宿。温泉付客室で贅沢なひとときをごゆっくりとお過ごしください。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F143298%2F143298.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 穴場の宿を今すぐチェック\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第6位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">神奈川県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.33 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/165731/165731.jpg\" alt=\"箱根湯本温泉　離れ山家荘\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">箱根湯本温泉　離れ山家荘</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">全室離れお部屋食の宿</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F165731%2F165731.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 穴場の宿を今すぐチェック\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold font-journal-serif text-stone-900 mb-4\">11年ぶりの大型連休を最高の旅に！</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6\">2026年のシルバーウィークは9/19〜23の5連休。さらに有給を2日取れば最大9連休も可能です。気になる宿は早めの空室チェックを！</p>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-50 to-amber-50/50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 shadow-sm\">\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-medium\">✍️ 編集部より：穴場の宿は「不便さ」が最大の武器。スマホの電波が弱い場所ほど、心が解放される不思議。デジタルデトックスにも最適です。</p>\n</div>\n",
